[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1505.43, "timestamp": "00:25:05", "text": "如果我犯了错误，就会落后。 我们会仔细检查一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1508.71, "timestamp": "00:25:08", "text": "或许我可以再仔细"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1511.83, "timestamp": "00:25:11", "text": "检查一遍，把所有东西都核对一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1517.35, "timestamp": "00:25:17", "text": "当然，我会犯很多错误，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1520.31, "timestamp": "00:25:20", "text": "因为我没怎么学习，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1539.51, "timestamp": "00:25:39", "text": "我的电量已充满。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1542.549, "timestamp": "00:25:42", "text": "我的意思是，我们可以读它，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1545.43, "timestamp": "00:25:45", "text": "对吧？ 感觉就像，你想想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1547.83, "timestamp": "00:25:47", "text": "我好像在考场上。 我可以拿到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1550.39, "timestamp": "00:25:50", "text": "我的试卷吗？ 我有时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1553.59, "timestamp": "00:25:53", "text": "读它。 所以，我们现在就可以读它了。"}]